      "originalReaderFields": {
        "reference": "Class 9 earlier-edition chapter PDF · exercise numbering may vary",
        "source": "https://cdn1.byjus.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/Tamilnadu-Board-Class-9-Maths-Textbook-Chapter-6-Term-II.pdf",
        "q": {
          "en": "Starting from sin θ = [[a|√(a² + b²)]], show that b sin θ = a cos θ.",
          "ta": "sin θ = [[a|√(a² + b²)]] எனில் b sin θ = a cos θ என்பதை நிரூபிக்கவும்."
        },
        "steps": [
          {
            "en": "Choose a positive right triangle whose opposite side is a and adjacent side is b.",
            "ta": "எதிர்ப்பக்கம் a, அடுத்துள்ள பக்கம் b கொண்ட செங்கோண முக்கோணத்தை எடுத்துக்கொள்க.",
            "eq": "Hypotenuse = √(a² + b²)"
          },
          {
            "en": "Write the adjacent-over-hypotenuse ratio.",
            "ta": "cos-க்கான அடுத்துள்ள / கர்ண விகிதத்தை எழுதுக.",
            "eq": "cos θ = [[b|√(a² + b²)]]"
          },
          {
            "en": "Multiply each ratio by the other side and compare.",
            "ta": "இரு விகிதங்களையும் மற்றொரு பக்கத்தால் பெருக்கி ஒப்பிடுக.",
            "eq": "b sin θ = [[ab|√(a² + b²)]]"
          },
          {
            "en": "The expression on the right simplifies to the same fraction.",
            "ta": "வலப்பக்கமும் அதே பின்னமாக எளிமையாகிறது.",
            "eq": "a cos θ = [[ab|√(a² + b²)]] = b sin θ"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "b sin θ = a cos θ",
        "page": 6
      },
      "disposition": "SOURCE_BLOCKED",
      "issue": "Neither edition restricts the sign of b. For a = 3, b = −4 and acute θ with sin θ = 3/5, b sin θ = −12/5 while a cos θ = 12/5.",
      "resolution": "Show the identity in the intended positive right-triangle setting. Keep the original question and include the exact signed counterexample.",
      "counterexample": {
        "a": 3,
        "b": -4,
        "sin": "3/5",
        "cos": "4/5",
        "lhs": "-12/5",
        "rhs": "12/5"
      }
    },
